    "archived real engines preserve old rosters/camps and paid queue state",
    "missing fog memory uses remembered floor, never unseen true terrain",
    "load mutates object inputs and refreshes derived sight; raw clone is a separate operation",
    "unsupported admission cases are rejected, not silently upgraded"
